===persian===

شب را
چگونه صبح خواهم کرد...
وقتی تو رفته‌ای...
مهتاب مانده است
و... مرغ شب ترانهٔ تاریکی را
یک ریز خوانده است...
۱۳۷۳/۶/۲۲

===machine===

How
am I to bring this night to morning...
now that you have gone...
The moonlight has stayed
and... the night bird has sung the song of the dark
without stopping once...
1373/6/22

===lantern===

How am I to bring this night to morning
now that you have gone?
The moonlight has stayed,
and the night bird has sung the song of the dark
without stopping once...

1373/6/22

